Thus $.016<N^{\rm src}_{02}<.018$, in particular $d>0$ from the positive-pivot adjugate. Each displayed comparison is a rational inequality after multiplication by positive denominators.

The inherited lower pivots are $.1$. Their upper bounds follow from (PG.4) and (PG.50):

$$
\begin{aligned}
(S_{02}^{\rm src})_{00}
 &=\lambda_{\rm src}/2-
 [(A_5^{\rm src})_{00}+(A_{27}^{\rm src})_{00}]/2
 <.24-(.21+.04)/2<.12,\\
